{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §4.2, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.12"
  description: """
    What `of` names decides what a reference holds, never its spelling, which is one. `record` is a
    constructor, so the values `meta.ref<record>` admits are types' names, and `widget`, whose value is of `record`,
    is one.
    """
  valid: {
    binds: [records holder held]
  }
